sequenceDiagram
  participant O as OTel/Monitor
  participant T as Temporal Incident Workflow
  participant D as Deterministic Classifier
  participant L as LiteLLM/Claude
  participant R as Runner
  participant G as GitHub
  participant H as Human
  O->>T: alert + trace/deployment refs
  T->>D: severity/correlation
  D-->>T: deterministic result
  T->>L: RCA evidence analysis
  L-->>T: hypothesis/remediation plan
  T->>R: optional repair task
  R->>G: repair PR
  G->>H: review/deploy approval
  H->>G: approve deployment
  T->>O: observe SLO recovery
